    "body": "Resolved the conflict with upstream #442 (Stock page theme button) in merge `8d67b13d` (upstream/main merged into this branch):\n\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: both sides added a test module at the same spot. Kept both: this branch's `mod setup_post_options;` and #442's `mod theme_door;`.\n\nGate (`scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main`, app + ui suites): all 11 pinning tests pass (8 in `setup_post_options`, 3 in `egui_app::tests::setup_post_options`), and #442's 5 `theme_door` tests pass on this tree too. The only reds are the known ones that also fail on main: the GPU headless tests (`headless_run_succeeds`, `headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, `egui_headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`) and `setup_stock_source::a_new_block_after_a_flip…` (#415, fixed by #420).\n\nThe branch merges cleanly with main. It stays a draft until the GUI check. The test binary `camcraft-ui-423` will be rebuilt from this tree.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
